# Staged, not committed.
#
# `make ios-stage-corpus` copies bundles/gutenberg-all/swift into this folder
# before an archive, so the App Store build ships the corpus inside the app.
# The folder itself is committed empty so that `make ios-build` and CI compile
# against an existing-but-empty path rather than a missing one; XcodeGen fails
# the build outright on a folder reference that does not exist.
#
# CorpusPacks.bundledDirectory() treats a folder with no manifest.json as
# "this build has no corpus", which is exactly the empty case.
